#: about-dialog.ui:36
msgctxt "AboutDialog|"
msgid "## Myrlyn "
msgstr ""

#: about-dialog.ui:65
msgctxt "AboutDialog|"
msgid ""
"Myrlyn is a graphical package manager to select\n"
"software packages and patterns for installation,\n"
"update and removal.\n"
"\n"
"It uses libzypp as its backend and Qt as its\n"
"GUI toolkit.\n"
"\n"
"This started in the 11/2024 SUSE Hack Week\n"
"to make the SUSE YaST Qt package selector usable\n"
"as a standalone Qt program without any YaST\n"
"dependencies."
msgstr ""

